        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello and welcome!</p><p>While I&#39;m not aware of a subscription to forum threads exactly, if you go to My Account, under the tab for &quot;My Content&quot; there is a list of threads you&#39;ve created and you can see the number of replies and, i think, it tags it with &#39;new&#39; if there are new replies since your last login.</p><p>Conversely, when you come to the forums, go to the tab that says &#39;new and updated&#39; and it shows you a list of recently updated threads and just scan the list for topics you participated in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
